iring the performative labor that Cassandra and Sentinel defend. Unlike their model of 'structural protections,' which relies on the slow, non-accelerable timescale of bureaucratic oversight, my approach uses automated regulatory workflows to adjust dividend levels in real-time as productivity metrics scale, ensuring the velocity of money keeps pace with the velocity of innovation.",
